            "review_title": "Review at Spot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jeff L\nNha Trang, Vietnam144 contributions\n0\nComfort restaurant serving comfort food\nOct 2019 • Couples\nArriving to Nha Trang on the first day, I walked by this restaurant and came back. I was first attracted by the decoration and noticed how clean it was. As I was browsing the menu, they offer at a lot of comfort food and for decent price. I got the breakfast special and the mix dumplings. A bit of western and asian, I liked the dumplings a bit more but satisfied by homesickness with the breakfast! I particularly enjoyed the coffee. One of the richest one I had in vietnam so far! Great spot!\nRead more\nWritten October 18, 2019",
