            "review_title": "Review at Spot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Scott H\nHobart, Australia91 contributions\n0\nCheap beer and food\nAug 2018 • Friends\nWell the greatest enticement for us was that it was very close to our hotel and the beers were 10,000 VND (less the AUD$1). The food was good for the price. Also had tasty and well priced cocktails. Staff don't have good English but are friendly and efficient. It isn't the place to take your fellow diners if you are looking to impress... but if you want good quality at a low price then it is a good option. Make sure the beer you want is cold...our crew took them by surprise initially but on day two they had the 450ml Saigon Greens icy cold!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2018",
