            "review_text": "lyndaann1975\nAustralia355 contributions\n0\nValue for money\nMay 2018 • Couples\nService is friendly and efficient \nThe food is basic simple hot and very good. It's not fancy its very simple but we enjoyed it. We went back first time I had chicken pho.lots of chicken good and tasty not strong and spicy but a good chicken noodle soup. My husband had the pancake both nights. Very.good serve..first one better than 2nd but both good. Tonight I had pork steak with egg and rice with a serve of Asian greens. Perfect. \nWell priced with a drink each average $10 for both of us. \nVery clean also \nWe would return\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 9, 2018",
